F,\\mathbb P,d)\\)</span> 为上游带概率空间的五参数定义；单参数形式为存在投影。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}levy-processes} \\vdash \\forall X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,d\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,d)\\to\\bigl(\\mathrm{IndependentIncrements}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,d)\\land\\mathrm{IndependentIncrements}_S(X)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}levy-processes} \\vdash \\forall X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,d\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,d)\\to\\bigl(\\mathrm{IndependentIncrements}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,d)\\land\\mathrm{IndependentIncrements}_S(X)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Lévy processes have independent stationary increments.</li>\n<li>This is their defining property.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md","status":"resolved","id":"d0a20d5f74408674","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md","status":"resolved","id":"d0a20d5f74408674","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S\\subseteq V^5$ 与 $\\mathrm{IndependentIncrements}_S\\subseteq V$（后者是上游定义中对所有有限递增时刻族的互独立增量谓词，see [[../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,d\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mat